@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About</PageTitle>

<h2>About Marquitos Primer Blazor Components</h2>

<br />

<p>
    <strong>Marquitos Primer Blazor Components</strong> is an open source library inspired by GitHub’s
    <strong>Primer Brand UI</strong> — the design system behind GitHub.com/marketing.
</p>

<p>
    The project aims to bring these high‑quality marketing components into the Blazor ecosystem,
    providing developers with a clean, consistent, and production‑ready set of UI building blocks.
</p>

<p>
    Whether you're creating landing pages, product sections, documentation layouts, or promotional
    content, this library helps you build modern interfaces with minimal effort — while staying fully
    aligned with the visual language of Primer.
</p>

<br />

<h3>Project Goals</h3>

<p>
    The primary objectives of the Marquitos Primer Blazor Components project are to: 
</p>
<ul>
    <li>Deliver reusable, flexible, and well‑structured Blazor components</li>
    <li>Mirror the look & feel of GitHub’s Primer Brand UI</li>
    <li>Provide developers with marketing‑grade UI elements</li>
    <li>Encourage community contributions and open collaboration</li>
    <li>Offer clear examples, documentation, and best practices</li>
</ul>

<br />

<h3>What’s Included</h3>

<p>
    The library currently includes a growing collection of components such as:
</p>
<ul>
    <li>Hero sections</li>
    <li>Call‑to‑Action blocks</li>
    <li>Section intros</li>
    <li>Bento layouts</li>
    <li>River layouts</li>
    <li>Logo grids</li>
    <li>Testimonials</li>
    <li>Timelines</li>
    <li>Feature comparison tables</li>
    <li>And more coming soon…</li>
</ul>

<br />

<h3>Open Source & Community Driven</h3>

<p>
    This project is fully open source and welcomes contributions from developers who want to help
    expand the component library, improve documentation, or refine the design system.
</p>

<p>
    You can explore the source code, report issues, or contribute directly through the GitHub
    repository:
</p>

<p>
    <a href="https://github.com/MarquitosPT/Marquitos.Primer.Blazor"
       title="Marquitos.Primer.Blazor" target="_blank">
        Visit the GitHub project page
    </a>
</p>

<br />

